[{"id":"app-testing-security-boundary","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["安全","边界"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十)隐私与安全测试.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十)隐私与安全测试","articlePath":"posts/3ee984a8/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十)隐私与安全测试.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十)隐私与安全测试","articlePath":"posts/3ee984a8/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 Deep Link 或 WebView 能打开页面，不代表安全边界正确？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>入口可达性与身份、授权、参数校验和会话隔离是不同问题。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>外部 Intent、重定向和 WebView 内容都应视为不可信输入。进入后仍要验证登录状态、资源归属、允许域名、桥接方法和退出清理；只证明页面显示会遗漏越权和数据残留。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-HTTP-007","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","缓存","ETag"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":7,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>304 Not Modified 说明了什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>服务端根据条件请求判断客户端已有表示仍可复用，响应通常不重新传输内容；客户端应使用本地缓存表示。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>304 不是“没有内容”或“服务端没工作”。要检查 If-None-Match/If-Modified-Since、ETag/Last-Modified 和缓存对象的实际版本。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>条件缓存可以用请求/响应字段对照：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>请求\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>响应\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>结论\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>If-None-Match\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>ETag\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>可验证对象版本\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>If-Modified-Since\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>Last-Modified\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>可按时间验证\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Cache-Control: no-cache\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>仍可能保存副本\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>使用前重新验证\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Cache-Control: no-store\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>不应保存副本\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>禁止存储\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-input-output-schema","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["Pydantic","契约"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(四)数据模型与响应契约.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(四)数据模型与响应契约","articlePath":"posts/ea590b49/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(四)数据模型与响应契约.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(四)数据模型与响应契约","articlePath":"posts/ea590b49/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么输入模型和输出模型通常要分开？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>输入和输出承担不同信任方向；分开后可以允许写入字段、隐藏内部字段并独立演进公开契约。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>写入模型描述客户端可提供的值，输出模型描述服务端愿意承诺的值。密码、owner_id 或审计元数据可能需要写入数据库，却不应沿响应返回。两个模型完全相同会让新增内部字段意外变成公开字段；分开还能让 OpenAPI 明确区分 requestBody 和 responses。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-vs-unittest","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["迁移"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(二)测试基础与执行模型.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(二)测试基础与执行模型","articlePath":"posts/9d696b94/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(二)测试基础与执行模型.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(二)测试基础与执行模型","articlePath":"posts/9d696b94/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Pytest 与 unittest 的兼容边界是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>Pytest 能运行 \u003ccode>unittest.TestCase\u003c/code>，但 Fixture 参数化等 Pytest 注入能力不会自动变成 TestCase 方法参数。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>兼容层解决的是“能被发现并运行”，不是把两套生命周期合并成同一套 API。旧的 \u003ccode>setUp\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>tearDown\u003c/code> 和 \u003ccode>self.assert*\u003c/code> 可以继续工作，但 Pytest 的 Fixture 参数不会自动注入 \u003ccode>TestCase\u003c/code> 方法。\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">class\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title class_\">TestDiscount\u003c/span>(unittest.TestCase):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_total\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">self\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"variable language_\">self\u003c/span>.assertEqual(apply_discount(\u003cspan class=\"number\">100\u003c/span>), \u003cspan class=\"number\">90\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_total_pytest\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">discount_service\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># Fixture 注入发生在普通测试函数签名中。\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">assert\u003c/span> discount_service(\u003cspan class=\"number\">100\u003c/span>) == \u003cspan class=\"number\">90\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>迁移时先保留旧测试的行为证据，再按模块改成普通函数、Fixture 或参数化；不要同时改变断言语义和依赖边界。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-NET-004","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["协议边界","排障"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":18,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么“能看到某一层的字段”不能直接证明整个请求成功？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>每层只能证明相应观察点存在；后续层仍可能失败。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>看到 ARP 只说明链路地址解析发生，看到 TCP 建立只说明传输连接建立，看到 HTTP 404 才说明某个 HTTP 服务返回了响应；结论必须标明已验证的层。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>排障时可以把证据写成一条逐层收窄的记录：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>观察点\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>能确认\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>还不能确认\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>ARP/ND 或 FDB\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>当前链路的下一跳线索\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>IP 路由和应用响应\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>TCP/TLS 握手\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>传输或安全会话建立\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>HTTP 状态和业务结果\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>HTTP 响应\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>某个服务返回了应用层结果\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>业务数据一定正确\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>这样“看到字段”会变成有边界的证据，而不是把某一层的成功扩大成端到端成功。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]